window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-b90e41678b0234ad"]={"zh":"<h1 id=\"_1\">快速入门</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"chatgpt\">在哪里使用 ChatGPT</h2> <p>ChatGPT 可在多种界面中使用，包括 <a href=\"#/article/a-d6f4398aa4652d7e\">ChatGPT 桌面应用</a>和<a href=\"#/article/a-7eb60a7a820b51e7\">网页版 ChatGPT</a>。请选择适合你工作的方式。</p> <blockquote> <p>配图说明：卡片对比 ChatGPT 桌面应用和网页版 ChatGPT</p> </blockquote> <p>如果你是开发者，想在终端或代码编辑器中使用 Codex，可以试试 <a href=\"#/article/a-24d888be8e5fa72d\">Codex CLI</a> 或 <a href=\"#/article/a-c7af5bbd57109077\">Codex IDE 扩展</a>。如果要远程编程，可以在网页或桌面应用中创建可复用的 <a href=\"#/article/a-7ac5ae1c18e03bf1\">Codex Cloud 环境</a>。创建新任务时，选择 <strong>Work in（工作位置）</strong> &gt; <strong>Cloud（云端）</strong>，打开 <strong>Select environment（选择环境）</strong>，然后选择 <strong>Create environment（创建环境）</strong>。Codex 会检查你的代码仓库，并帮助准备和测试环境，之后你再发布它。之后，你可以在网页端、移动设备或桌面应用中启动和继续云端任务。在移动设备上，打开 <strong>Codex</strong> 并选择已发布的环境。</p> <h2 id=\"_2\">设置</h2> <section id=\"codex-quickstart-setup\"> <h3 id=\"_3\">桌面应用</h3> <p>ChatGPT 桌面应用支持 macOS、Windows 和 Linux。你可以用它处理项目和本地文件、执行较长任务，也可以快速聊天。有关支持的 Linux 发行版和安装软件包，请参阅 <a href=\"#/article/a-8701a8c2ceb3943c\">Linux 桌面应用指南</a>。</p> <ol class=\"oai-bound-workflow\"> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-app-install\">安装 ChatGPT 桌面应用</h3> <p>选择适合你操作系统的版本：</p> <p class=\"notice\"><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/quickstart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">打开官方页面选择系统并下载（需联网）</a></p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-app-sign-in\">打开 ChatGPT 桌面应用并登录</h3> <p>打开应用，然后使用 ChatGPT 账户登录。</p> <p>你也可以使用 API 密钥运行 Codex。<a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=feature-availability\">部分功能可能不可用</a>。</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-app-select-workspace\">选择 ChatGPT 的工作位置</h3> <p>开始聊天、创建项目，或打开一个文件夹。ChatGPT 可以读取和修改你选择的文件夹中的文件。<a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">进一步了解聊天和项目</a>。</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-app-start-task\">开始聊天</h3> <ul> <li>如果你要进行研究、分析，或制作文档、演示文稿、电子表格和 Sites 等交付成果，请选择 <strong>ChatGPT</strong>，然后在新聊天页面顶部、输入框上方切换到 <strong>Work</strong>。</li> <li>如果要结合代码库上下文和开发者工具进行软件开发，请从 ChatGPT 下拉菜单中选择 <strong>Codex</strong>。</li> <li>如果只是快速提问或聊天，请选择 <strong>ChatGPT</strong>，然后在新聊天页面顶部、输入框上方的切换器中选择 <strong>Chat</strong>。在 Codex 中，将鼠标指向 <strong>New chat</strong>，然后选择其右侧的 <strong>Quick chat</strong> 图标。</li> </ul> <p>进一步了解<a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">如何使用 ChatGPT</a>。</p> <p class=\"notice\">原网页此处包含交互演示，请通过“查看官方来源”联网查看。</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-app-send-message\">发送第一条消息</h3> <p>描述你的目标，并添加 ChatGPT 需要的文件或上下文。试试以下示例：</p> <p><strong>制定决策：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Review the reports and notes in this project, compare the options, and create a one-page decision memo with a recommendation, risks, open questions, and source links.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p>中文意思：查看此项目中的报告和笔记，比较各个选项，并撰写一页决策备忘录，其中包含建议、风险、待解决问题和来源链接。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>分析电子表格：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Combine the spreadsheets in this folder, clean inconsistent records, identify the most important trends, and create a concise report with charts and plain-English takeaways.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p>中文意思：合并此文件夹中的电子表格，清理不一致的记录，找出最重要的趋势，并制作一份简明报告，包含图表和通俗易懂的结论。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>改进此应用：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Inspect this app, identify one high-impact usability improvement, implement it, update the relevant tests, and verify the result on mobile and desktop.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p>中文意思：检查此应用，找出一项影响较大的易用性改进并实施，更新相关测试，然后分别在移动设备和桌面设备上验证结果。</p> </blockquote> <p>探索更多<a href=\"#/article/a-63f294417c75d859\">使用场景（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p> </li> </ol> <h3 id=\"_4\">网页版</h3> <p>ChatGPT 可在网页端使用，并包含 Chat 和 ChatGPT Work。</p> <ol class=\"oai-bound-workflow\"> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-web-sign-in\">打开 ChatGPT 并登录</h3> <p>前往 <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT（需联网）</a>，使用 ChatGPT 账户登录。</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-web-start-task\">开始聊天</h3> <ul> <li>选择 <strong>Chat</strong>，以对话方式提问、探索想法并逐步讨论某个主题。</li> <li>选择 <strong>Work</strong>，研究和分析信息，并创建文档、演示文稿、电子表格、Sites 或其他完成品。</li> </ul> <p>进一步了解<a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">如何使用 ChatGPT</a>。</p> <p class=\"notice\">原网页此处包含交互演示，请通过“查看官方来源”联网查看。</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-web-select-workspace\">选择 ChatGPT 的工作位置</h3> <p>开始聊天或选择一个项目。项目可以包含聊天、文件和指令。</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-web-send-message\">发送第一条消息</h3> <p>描述你的目标，并添加 ChatGPT 需要的文件或上下文。试试以下示例：</p> <p><strong>做出决策：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Research whether I should [decision], compare the best options, explain the tradeoffs for my situation, and recommend one with citations.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p>中文意思：研究我是否应该做出[某项决定]，比较最佳选项，解释各选项对我当前情况的利弊，并附上引用后给出建议。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>每日简报：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Every weekday at 8:00 a.m., review my connected calendar and recent messages, then send me a briefing with today’s priorities, meeting prep, replies I owe, and blockers.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p>中文意思：每个工作日早上 8 点查看我已连接的日历和近期消息，然后发送一份简报，列出今天的优先事项、会议准备、我尚未回复的消息以及阻碍事项。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>规划活动：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Help me plan my event. Ask me about the occasion, guests, date, location, budget, and anything else you need. Then create a timeline, budget, invitation copy, and checklist, and publish a Site I can use to invite guests and collect RSVPs.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p>中文意思：帮我规划活动。先询问活动主题、来宾、日期、地点、预算和其他必要信息，然后制定时间表和预算、撰写邀请文案、制作检查清单，并发布一个可用于邀请来宾和收集回复的 Site。</p> </blockquote> </li> </ol> </section> <h2 id=\"_5\">后续步骤</h2> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-d6f4398aa4652d7e\"><strong>进一步了解 ChatGPT 桌面应用</strong><br>使用 ChatGPT 桌面应用处理本地项目。</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-2b09a0f3c8670621\"><strong>导入你的设置</strong><br>将受支持的设置、项目和近期工作导入 ChatGPT。</a></p>","en":"<h1 id=\"quickstart\">Quickstart</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"where-to-use-chatgpt\">Where to use ChatGPT</h2> <p>ChatGPT is available across different surfaces, including the <a href=\"#/article/a-d6f4398aa4652d7e\">ChatGPT desktop app</a> and <a href=\"#/article/a-7eb60a7a820b51e7\">ChatGPT on the web</a>. Choose the option that fits your work.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Cards compare the ChatGPT desktop app and ChatGPT on the web</p> </blockquote> <p>If you're a developer and want to use Codex in your terminal or code editor, try <a href=\"#/article/a-24d888be8e5fa72d\">Codex CLI</a> or the <a href=\"#/article/a-c7af5bbd57109077\">Codex IDE extension</a>. For remote coding work, create a reusable <a href=\"#/article/a-7ac5ae1c18e03bf1\">Codex Cloud environment</a> on the web or in the desktop app. In a new task, choose <strong>Work in</strong> &gt; <strong>Cloud</strong>, open <strong>Select environment</strong>, then select <strong>Create environment</strong>. Codex inspects your repositories and helps prepare and test the setup before you publish it. You can then start and continue cloud tasks on the web, on mobile, or in the desktop app. On mobile, open <strong>Codex</strong> and select the published environment.</p> <h2 id=\"setup\">Setup</h2> <section id=\"codex-quickstart-setup\"> <h3 id=\"desktop\">Desktop</h3> <p>The ChatGPT desktop app is available for macOS, Windows, and Linux. Use it for projects, local files, longer tasks, and quick chats. For supported Linux distributions and package installation, see the <a href=\"#/article/a-8701a8c2ceb3943c\">Linux desktop app guide</a>.</p> <ol class=\"oai-bound-workflow\"> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-app-install\">Install the ChatGPT desktop app</h3> <p>Choose the version for your operating system:</p> <p class=\"notice\"><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/quickstart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open the official page to choose your system and download (online)</a></p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-app-sign-in\">Open the ChatGPT desktop app and sign in</h3> <p>Open the app, then sign in with your ChatGPT account.</p> <p>You may also use Codex with an API key. <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=feature-availability\">Some features might not be available</a>.</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-app-select-workspace\">Select where ChatGPT should work</h3> <p>Start a chat, create a project, or open a folder. ChatGPT can read and modify files in the folder you choose. <a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">Learn more about chats and projects</a>.</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-app-start-task\">Start a chat</h3> <ul> <li>For research, analysis, or deliverables such as documents, presentations, spreadsheets, and Sites, select <strong>ChatGPT</strong>, then switch to <strong>Work</strong> at the top of the new chat page, above the composer.</li> <li>For software development with codebase context and developer tools, select <strong>Codex</strong> from the ChatGPT dropdown.</li> <li>For a quick question or chat, select <strong>ChatGPT</strong>, then select <strong>Chat</strong> in the switcher at the top of the new chat page, above the composer. In Codex, point to <strong>New chat</strong>, then select the <strong>Quick chat</strong> icon on its right.</li> </ul> <p>Learn more about <a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">using ChatGPT</a>.</p> <p class=\"notice\">This part of the official page contains an interactive demo. Open the official source online to view it.</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-app-send-message\">Send your first message</h3> <p>Describe your goal and add any files or context ChatGPT needs. Try an example:</p> <p><strong>Prepare a decision:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Review the reports and notes in this project, compare the options, and create a one-page decision memo with a recommendation, risks, open questions, and source links.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Analyze spreadsheets:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Combine the spreadsheets in this folder, clean inconsistent records, identify the most important trends, and create a concise report with charts and plain-English takeaways.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Improve this app:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Inspect this app, identify one high-impact usability improvement, implement it, update the relevant tests, and verify the result on mobile and desktop.\n</code></pre> <p>Explore more <a href=\"#/article/a-63f294417c75d859\">use cases (official source unavailable)</a>.</p> </li> </ol> <h3 id=\"web\">Web</h3> <p>ChatGPT is available on the web and includes Chat and ChatGPT Work.</p> <ol class=\"oai-bound-workflow\"> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-web-sign-in\">Open ChatGPT and sign in</h3> <p>Go to <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT (online)</a> and sign in with your ChatGPT account.</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-web-start-task\">Start a chat</h3> <ul> <li>Select <strong>Chat</strong> to ask questions, explore ideas, and work through a topic conversationally.</li> <li>Select <strong>Work</strong> to research, analyze information, and create documents, presentations, spreadsheets, Sites, or other finished work.</li> </ul> <p>Learn more about <a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">using ChatGPT</a>.</p> <p class=\"notice\">This part of the official page contains an interactive demo. Open the official source online to view it.</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-web-select-workspace\">Select where ChatGPT should work</h3> <p>Start a chat or select a project. Projects can include chats, files, and instructions.</p> </li> <li> <h3 id=\"setup-web-send-message\">Send your first message</h3> <p>Describe your goal and add any files or context ChatGPT needs. Try an example:</p> <p><strong>Make a decision:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Research whether I should [decision], compare the best options, explain the tradeoffs for my situation, and recommend one with citations.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Daily briefing:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Every weekday at 8:00 a.m., review my connected calendar and recent messages, then send me a briefing with today’s priorities, meeting prep, replies I owe, and blockers.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Plan an event:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Help me plan my event. Ask me about the occasion, guests, date, location, budget, and anything else you need. Then create a timeline, budget, invitation copy, and checklist, and publish a Site I can use to invite guests and collect RSVPs.\n</code></pre> </li> </ol> </section> <h2 id=\"next-steps\">Next steps</h2> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-d6f4398aa4652d7e\"><strong>Learn more about the ChatGPT desktop app</strong><br>Use the ChatGPT desktop app to work with your local projects.</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-2b09a0f3c8670621\"><strong>Import your setup</strong><br>Bring supported setup, projects, and recent work into ChatGPT.</a></p>"};
